        "original_id": "6290c0f9-ef70-5c28-87a8-c7c4139efbd0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dean Jones, Hayley Mills, Gordon Gordon, Mildred Gordon, Robert Stevenson\n- Works: That Darn Cat!, Undercover Cat\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Studios\n- Topics: American film, acting roles, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Dean Carroll Jones was born on January 25, 1931, and was an American actor.\n- The 1963 novel Undercover Cat was written by Gordon Gordon and Mildred Gordon.\n- That Darn Cat! is a 1965 American Walt Disney Productions thriller comedy film.\n- That Darn Cat! stars Hayley Mills in the last of her six films for the Walt Disney Studios.\n- That Darn Cat! stars Dean Jones in his first film for Disney.\n- That Darn Cat! is about bank robbers, a kidnapping, and a mischievous cat.\n- That Darn Cat! was based on the 1963 novel Undercover Cat.\n- That Darn Cat! was directed by Robert Stevenson.\n- Dean Jones was best known for his role as Agent Zeke Kelso in That Darn Cat!.\n- Dean Carroll Jones died on September 1, 2015.",
